{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Breakfast is at 8 o'clock, so the patients who can walk\non their own gather in the day room.": "",
  "But on the day of his disappearance, 8:30\ncame and went with no sign of Waku-san.": "",
  "But on the day of his disappearance,\n8:30 came and went with no sign of Waku-san.": "",
  "You thought you'd find him quickly.\nDidn't exactly turn out that way.": "",
  "You thought you'd find him quickly...\nBut it didn't exactly turn out that way.": "",
  "Got that, Yagami?\nHere, let's go over some more details.": "",
  "Got that?\nHere, let's go over some more details.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Sure, let's hear what the great\nShintani-sensei has to say.)</color>": "",
  "With me?\nThis thing's airtight, Yagami.": "",
  "See? The story's airtight, Yagami.": "",
  "I know you're getting into this,\nbut come on.": "",
  "Just give it up already.\nYou don't have a chance.": "",
  "Even though Okubo says he's innocent?": "",
  "I promised him we'd do\neverything we could.": "",
  "Not my problem.\nYou shouldn't make promises you can't keep.": "",
  "Not my problem.\nDon't make promises you can't keep.": "",
  "...Fine, then I'll do it alone.\nYou don't have to be involved.": "",
  "Fine, then I'll do it alone!\nYou can sit this one out, Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "Even if I'm not...\nThe loss'll hurt Genda-sensei's reputation.": "",
  "Even if I did...\nYour loss'll hurt Genda-sensei's reputation.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but our client says he's innocent.\nI can't back down from this.": "",
  "I'm sorry? Our client says he's innocent.\nI can't back down from this.": "",
  "...Fine.\nI'll be in the lobby.": "",
  "...Do what you want.\nI'll be in the lobby.": "",
  "Um, if you like... I could take you\nto see Waku-san's room again.": "",
  "Um, if you'd like...\nI could take you to see Waku-san's room again.": "",
  "You don't mind?\nThat would be great.": "",
  "You don't mind?\nThat'd be great.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Here I am again. Don't really see\nanything out of the ordinary, though.)</color>": "",
  "Um... Are you finished?": "",
  "Not yet.\nJust a little longer.": "",
  "Not yet.\nI'm still looking around.": "",
  "Yeah, I've seen what I need.\nAnything else you can share?": "",
  "All right, I've seen all I need to see.\nAnything else?": "",
  "How long will Okubo-san's sentence be?": "",
  "If he's found guilty, that is.": "",
  "Probably 10 years, maybe more.\nIt's hard to say for sure.": "",
  "Ten years...? Maybe more.\nIt's hard to say for sure.": "",
  "And what if he confesses?\nWould they shorten his sentence?": "",
  "And what if he confesses?\nWould they shorten Okubo-san's sentence?": "",
  "At the very least, it'd make a better impression\nthan insisting he didn't do it.": "",
  "I'm sure the prosecution would appreciate it.\nMore than pleading innocence, at least.": "",
  "But you're still going to push an innocent plea?\nEven though Okubo-san is the one who'll suffer for it?": "",
  "But that's the plea you'll enter, right?\nEven though Okubo-san is the one who'll suffer for it?": "",
  "If he's really not guilty,\nhe won't have to. I'll win.": "",
  "If he's really innocent, he won't suffer.\nI'll win.": "",
  "But to be perfectly honest,\nthis is my first criminal case.": "",
  "If I'm being honest, though...\nThis is my first criminal case.": "",
  "Civil cases have been a mixed bag for me,\ntoo. I've actually lost more than I've won.": "",
  "Civil cases have been a mixed bag for me, too.\nI've actually lost more than I've won.": "",
  "Oh, really?": "",
  "Apparently a \"smart\" lawyer would never even\nconsider an innocent plea in this case.": "",
  "For this case... I've been told a \"smart\" lawyer\nwouldn't even think of pleading innocent.": "",
  "Guess it's a good thing that I'm not so smart, then...\nBecause I honestly believe I can win.": "",
  "Terasawa-san.\nWere you close to Okubo-kun?": "",
  "I spoke to him pretty often, yes.\nI would see him around the ward all the time.": "",
  "I spoke to him fairly often, yes.\nI would see him around the ward all the time.": "",
  "And what did you think of him? Did he seem like\nthe kinda guy who'd do something like this?": "",
  "So, do you think Okubo's the kind of guy\nwho could do this?": "",
  "...I'm sorry.\nThe director told us not to say too much.": "",
  "If you know anything that can help...\nJust get in touch, okay?": "",
  "If you know anything that can help...\nJust call me.": "",
  "I'll do whatever it takes\nto set Okubo-kun free.": "",
  "I'll do whatever it takes to set Okubo-kun free.": "",
  "But I can't do it alone. Just...\ngive it some thought, Terasawa-san.": "",
  "But I don't think I can do it alone.\nJust... think about it, Terasawa-san.": "",
  "On the day of the crime,\nyou were in the general ward of the ADDC, yes?": "",
  "Starting at 8 AM, you went around\nto each room and gathered the linens.": "",
  "Starting at 8 AM, you went to each room\nand gathered the linens.": "",
  "Yes, nobody would dispute that.": "",
  "Yes, of course...\nNobody would dispute that.": "",
  "And after that, you covered Waku-san's nose and mouth,\nsuffocated him, and then carted him out in a laundry bin.": "",
  "And after that, you covered Waku-san's nose and mouth,\nsuffocated him, and wheeled him out in a laundry cart.": "",
  "That's not true. Waku-san wasn't\nthere when I went into his room.": "",
  "That's not true. Waku-san wasn't there\nwhen I went into his room.": "",
  "I didn't see him at all that day.\nYou have to believe me...!": "",
  "I swear, I didn't see Waku-san\nat all that day!": "",
  "Now, you left the hospital\nin your truck around 10 AM.": "",
  "But when you went to unload\nthe linens from the flatbed...": "",
  "You realized there was a body\nhidden among them.": "",
  "And I do.": "",
  "So when you went down to leave the center\nat 10 AM after gathering the linens...": "",
  "So you finished collecting the sheets at around 10 AM,\nbut when you went to leave the hospital...": "",
  "You realized there was a body\nhidden in the truck.": "",
  "...You found the body of the victim\nstashed in the flatbed of your truck.": "",
  "Yes, that's what happened.": "",
  "That's... what happened, yes.": "",
  "Then after debating whether or not to report the body,\nyou chose to hide it in the mountains.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's gonna be a huge hurdle to climb in the trial...)</color>": "",
  "I had a criminal assault on my record. I knew\nthe police would've suspected me if I went to them.": "",
  "I had a criminal assault on my record.\nThe police would've suspected me if I went to them. So...": "",
  "Aren't you forgetting the bad blood\nyou had with Waku-san?": "",
  "If I recall, there was some kind of trouble between\nyou and Waku-san, wasn't there?": "",
  "Bad blood?\nWhat are you talking about?": "",
  "Trouble? What are you talking about?": "",
  "Three days before the murder, Waku-san claimed\nOkubo-kun here punched him and stole his wallet.": "",
  "Three days before the murder, Waku-san claimed\nOkubo-kun punched him and stole his wallet.": "",
  "They told me all about it at the Center.": "",
  "When did you even ask?": "",
  "When did you have the time to ask that?": "",
  "While you were busy chatting up\nTerasawa-chan.": "",
  "Even if I bitch about it,\nI'm still damn good at my job.": "",
  "Heh. I might complain the whole way,\nbut I still do my job.": "",
  "Well, Okubo-kun?\nDid you take his wallet, or...": "",
  "Well, Okubo-kun?\nDid you take Waku-san's wallet, or...": "",
  "Not quite!": "",
  "He didn't.": "",
  "They call it delusion of theft.": "",
  "They call it delusion of theft, right?": "",
  "It's a symptom of dementia. You think something's been\nstolen from you, then blame the first person you see.": "",
  "Not the easiest thing to deal with, right?": "",
  "Someone accuses you of theft for no reason?\nMust have been a shock!": "",
  "Outta the blue, someone starts calling you a thief.\nProbably a pretty big shock.": "",
  "So when Waku-san tried to hit you,\nyou just about hit him back.": "",
  "So when the old man tried to hit you,\nyou just about hit him back.": "",
  "But I didn't hit him.": "",
  "No. You murdered him.": "",
  "Right... You jumped to murder.": "",
  "I wouldn't kill a man over\nsomething like that.": "",
  "I couldn't... I'd never kill a man\nover something like that.": "",
  "I wish I could believe you, pal.": "",
  "I sure wish I could believe you, kiddo.": "",
  "C'mon Okubo-kun.\nYou've got a record of violence.": "",
  "Okubo-kun... You've gotten violent\nwith women before, too.": "",
  "It wasn't me, I swear.\nSomebody set me up.": "",
  "Please, you have to believe me! Whoever did this\nis laughing at all of us right now!": "",
  "Please, you have to believe me!\nWhoever did this is laughing at all of us right now!": "",
  "Calm down!": "",
  "Yagami-sensei...\nDo you believe me?": "",
  "Yagami-sensei...\nDo you really believe me?": "",
  "Okay...\nThen next time, come alone.": "",
  "Then... next time, please come alone.": "",
  "Fine, I can take a hint. You and Yagami-sensei\ncan cuddle up all you want.": "",
  "Don't worry, I can take a hint.\nI'll be out of your hair from now on.": "",
  "Hey, you know that nurse,\nTerasawa-san? Cute girl.": "",
  "Hey. That nurse, Terasawa-san...\nYou know her? Cute girl.": "",
  "It sounded like she was worried about you.\nBet you'd have a chance with her once you get out of here.": "",
  "It sounded like she was worried about you.\nOnce you're free, you should ask her out.": "",
  "I dunno.\nIf you'll excuse me.": "",
  "...Yeah.\nIf you'll excuse me.": "",
  "So Shintani just left you hanging, huh?": "",
  "And that was it?\nShintani just left you there?": "",
  "He's gotta learn some damn patience.": "",
  "He's gotta learn some patience.": "",
  "Maybe so... but this is my case now.\nI can handle it myself.": "",
  "Maybe... but this is my case now.\nI can handle it on my own.": "",
  "Heh. Okay.": "",
  "Heh. Right.": "",
  "Have you seen Mafuyu lately?": "",
  "Have you met up with Mafuyu recently?": "",
  "Where's this coming from?": "",
  "Huh? Where's this coming from?": "",
  "She's just not that great with men.": "",
  "Look, she's not really used to\ndealing with men.": "",
  "I suggest you be more assertive.": "",
  "You should be more assertive.": "",
  "Right, okay.": "",
  "You mean that friend of yours, Saori-kun?": "",
  "She's got Shintani all riled up.": "",
  "Shintani's all bitter about her.": "",
  "Said he'd've been nicer to you if he knew\nyou had friends who looked like her. Jackass.": "",
  "Said he'd have been nicer to you\nif he knew you had pretty friends like her.": "",
  "Hey, nothing's official yet, guys.": "",
  "Nothing's official yet anyway, guys.": "",
  "Yet? That word says more than you think.": "",
  "\"Yet,\" you say?\nThe word speaks volumes.": "",
  "Regardless, keep it on the downlow, okay?": "",
  "Regardless, no gossiping, okay?": "",
  "I'll keep my lips sealed.": "",
  "I'll give you space, don't worry.": "",
  "Mafuyu-kun's a prosecutor, right? Isn't it kinda\ntaboo for her to date a defense attorney?": "",
  "Mafuyu-kun's a prosecutor, right?\nIsn't it kinda taboo to date the defense?": "",
  "Can we not do this?": "",
  "Can we please stop talking about this?": "",
  "Either way, guess the Okubo case comes first.\nWe're pleading innocent, yeah?": "",
  "Either way, guess Shinpei Okubo comes first.\nYou're pleading innocent, yeah?": "",
  "That's the plan.": "",
  "What is your plan here?\nThis isn't gonna be an easy win.": "",
  "But how are you going to clinch it?\nDo you have a strategy?": "",
  "Well, I'm working on that. There's one piece\nof evidence that still bothers me.": "",
  "Well, sorta. There's one piece of evidence\nthat's been bothering me.": "",
  "Yeah? And what's that?": "",
  "Oh?\nAnd what's that?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What should I focus on if I want to\nprove Okubo innocent?)</color>": "",
  "It's the hospital room\nthe victim was staying in.": "",
  "It's the hospital room that the victim\nwas staying in.": "",
  "This is the last place Waku-san\nwas seen before he disappeared.": "",
  "Their witness claims he saw\nWaku-san lying in his bed here.": "",
  "At the time...": "",
  "But at the time...": "",
  "The witness would have seen Waku-san from\nthis angle through the window in the door.": "",
  "The witness would have seen Waku-san\nfrom this angle through the window in the door.": "",
  "But the cabinet here would have\nbeen blocking his face.": "",
  "But the cabinet here would\nhave been blocking his face.": "",
  "In other words, there's room to argue that the witness\nnever actually saw Waku-san to begin with.": "",
  "It might've just looked like there was somebody in there.\nOr maybe the killer set it up to look that way.": "",
  "And how would that impact the trial?": "",
  "Well, the premise that the victim was still alive\nat 8 o'clock would no longer be on the table.": "",
  "Well, the premise that the victim was still alive at 8 o'clock\nwould no longer be on the table.": "",
  "Meaning the crime could have occurred\nduring a much wider time range.": "",
  "Meaning the timeframe could be much wider\nthan we initially thought.": "",
  "With that in mind, we could claim there's no proof\nthat Okubo took Waku-san out of the room.": "",
  "Right. Not bad.": "",
  "Right.\nNot bad.": "",
  "This is Waku-san, the victim.": "",
  "Suffocation is the apparent cause of death,\nbut they still haven't nailed it down conclusively.": "",
  "As for his body,\nit was found buried in the mountains of Okutama.": "",
  "As for his body, it was found in\nthe mountains of Okutama.": "",
  "And Okubo's the one who told them\nwhere it was, right?": "",
  "As I've seen,\nhe's admitted to that much at least.": "",
  "You must be aware he even admitted\nto dumping it there.": "",
  "Yes, but he insists he didn't\ncommit the murder.": "",
  "Yes. But he insists he didn't\ncommit the murder.": "",
  "Maybe so, but you're gonna need evidence\nif you wanna prove it.": "",
  "Well, whatever the case, you'll need proof.": "",
  "They find anything on the body?": "",
  "Maybe something that'd give\nour man an alibi?": "",
  "For example... something that'd give\nour man an alibi?": "",
  "...No, nothing like that.": "",
  "That's a shame.": "",
  "That's not my point, though.\nThe evidence I showed you is...": "",
  "That's not my point, though.\nThe evidence I showed you is—": "",
  "That evidence won't win you the case.": "",
  "The DNA sample they\nfound from Waku-san.": "",
  "This is the DNA sample they found\nfrom Waku-san.": "",
  "It was in the flatbed of the truck\nOkubo-kun used for work.": "",
  "Right, that's why they went after\nOkubo in the first place.": "",
  "Right. That's why they went after Okubo\nin the first place.": "",
  "As for Waku-san's body, it was hidden in the pile of sheets\nthat had been loaded into the truck.": "",
  "Okubo-kun said he didn't notice it until\nhe got to the linen supplier's factory.": "",
  "As for Waku-san's body, it was hidden in the pile\nof sheets that had been loaded into the truck.": "",
  "He said he noticed it when he was\njust about to leave the ADDC.": "",
  "According to Okubo-kun,\nhe didn't notice it until he was leaving the ADDC.": "",
  "And then he panicked and buried\nthe body in the mountains of Okutama.": "",
  "So, he panicked and buried the body\nin the mountains of Okutama?": "",
  "As I've seen, he's admitted\nto that much at least, right?": "",
  "He admitted to that much, didn't he?": "",
  "Maybe so, but you're gonna\nneed evidence if you wanna prove it.": "",
  "Did we get anything else from that truck?": "",
  "Did we get anything else from the truck?": "",
  "Like maybe a DNA sample\nfrom the actual killer?": "",
  "This is the laundry bin that was thought\nto have been used to transport Waku-san's body.": "",
  "This is the laundry cart thought to have been used\nto transport Waku-san's body.": "",
  "Okubo-kun, the laundry man,\nwould have been responsible for it.": "",
  "Okubo-kun would have been\nresponsible for it.": "",
  "Where exactly are you going\nwith this, Yagami?": "",
  "I understand that, just...\nWhere are you going with this?": "",
  "It was only about 40 minutes between when\nWaku-san was last seen and when he disappeared.": "",
  "It was only about 40 minutes between when\nWaku-san was last seen and his disappearance.": "",
  "There's only one way his body\ncould have been carried out discreetly.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Oh, really?": "จริงเหรอ?",
  "Calm down!": "ใจเย็นๆ ก่อน!",
  "Heh. Okay.": "เฮ้อ ก็ได้",
  "Heh. Right.": "ฮึ ใช่เลย",
  "Where's this coming from?": "มาจากไหนกันเนี่ย?",
  "Huh? Where's this coming from?": "หา? อยู่ดีๆ ถามเรื่องนี้มาได้ไง?",
  "That's the plan.": "นั่นแหละที่ตั้งใจไว้",
  "Yeah? And what's that?": "อ้อเหรอ? แล้วมันคืออะไร?"
 }
}
